# env & secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Wrangler's local secrets file — same risk as .env, different name.
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
!.dev.vars.example
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
# The Tauri updater signing key (ARCHITECTURE §9). Committing it would let anyone sign an
# "update" that every install accepts and executes, so it is the worst secret in the project
# to leak. Generate it outside the repo; this is defence in depth, not the plan.
*.key
!*.key.pub
